abstract: >
  This repository contains a Jupyter Notebook and supporting Python code for
  data-driven Bayesian empirical fragility modelling. The workflow implements
  hierarchical generalized linear models and MCMC-based parameter estimation
  to derive probabilistic fragility curves from observed damage data.

type: software
